Apply:  cd $VERL_CHECKOUT && git apply recipe/dynamo/patches/<this file>

VERL_DEFER_OPTIMIZER_LOAD=1: keep Adam state on CPU through forward/backward and load it only around optimizer.step().

Opt-in via env var; off by default. Measured 7.11 GB/GPU freed at the actor-update peak (Qwen3-30B-A3B, 32-GPU FSDP).
Needed to fit 30B GRPO on 2x8 H100; the verified 4x8 runs (job 17562481) ran with it OFF.
diff --git a/verl/workers/engine/fsdp/transformer_impl.py b/verl/workers/engine/fsdp/transformer_impl.py
